lmstlabel       INIT    "Status+customerName+ktpNumber+contractNumber+motorName+engineNumber+bodyNumber+typeDocument1+platCompletedAt+platTakenAt+platTakenBy+platLocationName+platLocationAddress+platLatitude+platLongitude"
